{
  "id": "level_c12_win",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "",
      "text": "战斗结束的时候，祭坛边还躺着一个东西。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "keeper",
      "text": "不是畸变体。是一个魔女。灰斗篷，身上的骨刺只长到一半，正在慢慢缩回去。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "keeper",
      "text": "她还有一口气。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "人偶蹲下去，把手按在她胸口。蓝色的蛛丝从掌心溢出来，很轻地裹住那个人。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "一具身体倒下去。另一具身体里，多了一点东西。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "echo",
      "illustration": "",
      "text": "老师……对不起……"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "witch",
      "illustration": "witch_shadow",
      "text": "感觉到了吗？那是她的情绪。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "witch",
      "illustration": "witch_shadow",
      "text": "她到最后都在愧疚。愧疚是很好的燃料。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "witch",
      "illustration": "witch_shadow",
      "text": "但对你来说，没有意义。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "doll",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "她为什么愧疚？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "witch_shadow",
      "text": "织骸沉默。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "witch_shadow",
      "text": "很久。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "doll",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "你为什么不回答？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "witch_shadow",
      "text": "织骸没有回答。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "illustration": "doll",
      "text": "祭坛的蓝光在她脸上晃了一下。她第一次没有立刻站起来。"
    }
  ]
}
